{"archivedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","archivedInDashboard":false,"attachedStylesheets":[],"authorName":"Shawn Peterson","categoryId":1,"contentTypeCategory":4,"createdAt":"2026-06-30T18:12:27.306Z","createdById":"26261533","currentState":"DRAFT","domain":"info.davincilabs.com","featuredImage":"","featuredImageAltText":"","htmlTitle":"Custom Formulation Services | DaVinci Private Label","id":"216189433487","language":"en","layoutSections":{},"metaDescription":"Beyond private label: custom formulation when our stock catalog doesn't fit. Higher minimums, longer timeline, full proprietary ownership of the result.","name":"Private Label - Page - Custom Formulation","pageRedirected":false,"publicAccessRules":[],"publicAccessRulesEnabled":false,"publishDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","published":false,"slug":"pl-demo-custom-formulation","state":"DRAFT","subcategory":"site_page","templatePath":"Private Label/Templates/Page.html","translations":{},"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T19:42:12.069Z","updatedById":"26261533","url":"https://info.davincilabs.com/pl-demo-custom-formulation","useFeaturedImage":false,"widgetContainers":{"main_content":{"widgets":[{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">BEYOND PRIVATE LABEL</p>\n    <h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Custom formulation when our stock catalog doesn't fit.</h1>\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">If you need something we don't already make, our R&D team can develop custom formulations to your specifications. Higher minimums, longer timeline, full proprietary ownership.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Discuss a Custom Formulation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608831,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">Private label gets you to market in weeks. Custom formulation gets you a moat.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Most brands launch with private label. It's the fastest path to market and the lowest-risk way to validate audience and channel. As brands scale, some develop signature products that need proprietary formulations: a unique blend, a specific delivery format, an ingredient combination that doesn't exist elsewhere.</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Our R&D team can develop those for you. The trade-off is timeline (6 to 12 months for full development), minimums (significantly higher than private label), and shared development cost. But the result is yours: a proprietary product that competitors cannot copy from our catalog.</p>\n</div>"},"id":216201608832,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9.75 3.1v5.66m4.5-5.66v5.66m-4.5 0a3.38 3.38 0 0 1-1.5 6.43m6-6.43a3.38 3.38 0 0 0 1.5 6.43M4.5 19.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5 4.5h6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5-4.5v-4.31a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5-4.5h-6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5 4.5v4.31Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Doctor-formulated R&D</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Same R&D process that builds DaVinci's own product line. Doctor formulators, clinical research, ingredient sourcing, prototype development, and stability testing.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Proprietary ownership</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Custom formulations belong to your brand. They are not added to our private label catalog. Competitors cannot copy them from us.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M21 7.5 12 12m0 0L3 7.5M12 12v9.75m0-9.75 9-4.5M3 7.5l9 4.5M3 7.5v9l9 4.5m9-13.5v9L12 21.75\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Full format flexibility</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Capsules, tablets, powders, softgels, chewables, liquids, oral sprays. Format selection driven by your formulation needs.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608833,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 70px 20px 30px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">WHEN TO CHOOSE CUSTOM</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;\">Is custom formulation right for you?</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608834,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 10px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">You have an established brand with proven private label momentum</p>\n    </div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Your customers are asking for something that does not exist in our catalog</p>\n    </div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">You have validated audience and channel demand for a specific product</p>\n    </div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">You want a moat against competitors copying your hero SKU</p>\n    </div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">You can commit to higher minimums and a 6 to 12 month development timeline</p>\n    </div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">You want proprietary ownership of the formulation</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608835,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to launch your private label supplement line?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Schedule a consultation. We will walk through your audience, the right formulations for them, branding options, and the timeline.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608836,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218949791159,"label":"PL - Global Guide Offer","module_id":218944099153,"order":6,"type":"module"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608838,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>When does custom formulation make sense instead of private label?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Custom formulation makes sense when you need a formulation that doesn't exist in our catalog, when you want proprietary ownership of the formula, when you're targeting a specific clinical outcome that requires specific dosages, or when you have a defensible insight about an ingredient combination. For most first-time brands, private label is the right starting point.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What are typical timelines for custom formulation?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">12 to 16 weeks from concept to production-ready, depending on complexity. The phases: formulation development, ingredient sourcing, stability testing, final formulation lock, manufacturing scale-up, and first production run. Some categories take longer because of stability testing requirements.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What are the minimums for custom formulation?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Higher than private label, because we need to amortize R&D, ingredient sourcing, and stability testing investments. Typical custom minimums start in the low thousands of bottles per SKU. We give you specific numbers during the scoping conversation.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Who owns the custom formula we develop together?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">You do. Custom formulations are your proprietary IP. We document the formula in a way that you could (in theory) take to another manufacturer, though we hope you won't. The development relationship is transparent: you see the rationale, the testing, and the final spec.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can custom formulations contain branded ingredients (Sensoril, NKO, etc.)?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. We have supplier relationships with most major branded ingredient companies. Branded ingredients add cost but give you marketing leverage (the brand story, the published research). We help you decide where branded ingredients are worth the premium and where they aren't.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608839,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950233503,"label":"PL - Global FDA Disclaimer","module_id":218942529652,"order":9,"type":"module"}]}},"widgets":{}}